      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ComfyUI_LC_AV_nodes — node list\n\nClass names are what you search. Titles are the graph labels.\n\n## Pipe\n\n| Title | Class | What it does |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| LC AV Pipe (in/edit) 🎬 | `LCAvPipeEdit` | Build or edit an `LC_AV_PIPE`. Inputs top-down: `pipe` (`LC_PIPE`), `av_pipe` (`LC_AV_PIPE`), then video, audio, fps, duration, prompts, seed, steps, etc. Wired slots override; empty slots pass through. Out: `av_pipe` only. |\n| LC AV Pipe Out 🎬 | `LCAvPipeOut` | Unpack. In: `pipe` + `av_pipe`. Out: `av_pipe` plus video, audio, fps, duration, and the shared LC123 fields. No `LC_PIPE` on the output side. |\n| LC Pipe → AV Pipe 🔌 | `LCPipeToAvPipe` | One socket in (`LC_PIPE`), one out (`LC_AV_PIPE`). Copies shared keys only. No widgets. |\n\n`LC_PIPE` and `LC_AV_PIPE` stay separate types. Video/audio never write back into `LC_PIPE`.\n\n## Video / I/O\n\n| Title | Class | What it does |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| LC Create Video 🎬 | `LCCreateVideo` | Pack an `IMAGE` batch (+ optional `AUDIO`) into `LC_AV_PIPE`. Does **not** encode a file. Out: pipe, images, frame_rate, duration, frame_count. |\n| LC Save Video 💾 | `LCSaveVideo` | Encode frames to mp4/webm/av1 (ffmpeg). VHS-style options: frame_rate, loop_count, filename_prefix, format, pix_fmt, crf, pingpong, save_output, prune_outputs. Optional audio mux. In: images, audio, pipe, av_pipe, metadata. Preview after encode. `prune_outputs` keeps intermediate frame PNGs off disk. |\n| LC Save Video Metadata 🏷️ | `LCSaveVideoMetadata` | Builds `LC_SAVE_META` for Save Video **or** LC123 Save Image. Widgets: positive, negative, seed, steps, sampler, scheduler, cfg, width, height, denoise, models, civitai_air. Out: metadata dict + A1111 `parameters` string. |\n| LC Final Frame 🖼️ | `LCFinalFrame` | Last frame of an `IMAGE` batch. |\n| LC VAE Decode 🧩 | `LCVaeDecode` | Switch only: **full** = core `VAE Decode`, **tiled** = core `VAE Decode (Tiled)` (tile_size, overlap, temporal_size, temporal_overlap). No extra latent handling. |\n| LC Get Latent Size 📐 | `LCGetLatentSize` | Pixel `width` / `height` (latent × compression). Optional `vae` for compression, else widget (default 8). Also `batch` and `frames`. |\n\nCivitai: upload the first-frame **PNG** Save Video writes next to the mp4 (`civitai_still`). Civitai does not read mp4 comment. Fill `models` and `civitai_air` on the metadata node.\n\n## Audio\n\n| Title | Class | What it does |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| LC Load Audio 📂 | `LCLoadAudio` | Load from input/output/temp. Out: `AUDIO`, duration (float seconds). Preview button on this node only. |\n| LC Audio Duration ⏱️ | `LCAudioDuration` | Out: seconds (int), seconds (float). |\n| LC Audio Crop ✂️ | `LCAudioCrop` | Crop `AUDIO` with `start_time` / `end_time` as `MM:SS`. |\n| LC Audio Channel 🎚️ | `LCAudioChannel` | Stereo → L / R. Mono is copied to both. |\n| LC Audio Separate 🎼 | `LCAudioSeparate` | Hybrid Demucs stems: Bass, Drums, Other, Vocals. Needs torchaudio. No Numba/SoX. |\n| LC Audio EQ 3-Band 🎛️ | `LCAudioEqualizer3Band` | Low shelf, peaking mid, high shelf. NumPy biquads. 0 dB bands skipped. |\n| LC Audio Volume 🔊 | `LCAudioVolume` | Gain slider 0–4 (1.0 = unity). Soft-clip after gain. |\n\n\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
